  "prefLabel": "Fis 803.12 Notification of Import of Wildlife",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 803.12 Notification of Import of Wildlife. Any person importing wildlife, including fish, after obtaining a permit pursuant to Fis 803.05 shall make notification to the fish and game department, within 5 days of importation, that wildlife has been brought into the state by completing the “Notification of Import of Wildlife” form, Rev 04/2026, available on the department’s website at https://www.wildlife.nh.gov/licenses-and-permits/license-forms.\n\nSource. #6889, eff 11-21-98, EXPIRED: 11-21-06\n\nNew. #8767, INTERIM, eff 11-22-06, EXPIRED: 5-21-07\n\nNew. #8893, eff 6-5-07, EXPIRED: 6-5-15\n\nNew. #10868, INTERIM, eff 6-25-15, EXPIRED: 12-22-15 (formerly Fis 803.12) (See Revision Note at part heading for Fis 803)\n\nNew. #11029, eff 1-26-16; ss by #14558, eff 4-21-26, EXPIRES: 4-21-36 (formerly Fis 803.11)",
